														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-3625732">
									

<p>I'm not sure why one would go through so much trouble to mainstain tight and consistent tone through the procedures, clearly sticking to the tried-and-true SCP-writing method of keeping strict verisimilitude&#8230;and then give into including a goofy silly task force name.</p>
<p>Really takes one out of the work. Where before I was immersed enough to digest half a dozen paragraphs of procedures and protocol because the realism was on-point, I was immediately reminded in brutal fashion that this is just some random story cooked up by someone on the internet. I don't mind silly names and punny designations, but I think they have their place, and this isn't it.</p>

