<p>I see what you mean by it being immersion breaking, but I guess I was just used to seeing quirky task force names regularly on the site. I've removed it anyway, as the edition of a new MTF felt quite unnecessary on another read seeing as there is already a perfectly usable MTF specialized in oceanic anomalies.</p>
<p>Is there anything else about it you didn't like, apart from the task force designation? Thanks for the critique anyway.</p>

